Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the prettiest beach setup\Nfor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead on Saturday\NNovember 7th, but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a usable stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best window is 7:30 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to 11:30 AM at the Devereux
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Picnic Shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan on around 57 degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,wind at 8 mph, and rain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,showers likely, with a 55\Npercent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,High tide is 9:34 AM, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the shelter is the practical\Ncall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, patchy fog may cut down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,visibility near the water.
